 and I love the life and storytelling displayed in the pictures! I would like to request you to draw my OC if possible!\n\n【キャラクター設定紹介】\n・新井典予 173cm\n神社の家系に生まれたしっかり者の民俗学者。彼は電子機器が苦手なんだ。\n他人に対して社交的に非常に礼儀正しいが、友達の前では優しくし。\n・野弥苍真 183cm\nゲーム好きなハッカー。不器用なところもあって、友達の前だと素直で明るくなる。\n2人は一緒に住んでいる親友という設定です。\n\n【Relationship between two people】\nEven though they are not committed to the same field, they still respect each other's ideals in learning to understand.\n新井典予 usually takes care of 野弥苍真.\nHe's more like an older brother.\nI'd love it if you'd refer to a bright, lively atmosphere.Such as an island getaway or a lunch break!\n\nI would be happy if you were free to create accordingly!Thank you for your patience in reading！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12sutanvWTZal7ly49wEnAKhfeYqf0JqV?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sandborer_24/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2640611, "client_id": 2991126, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8bc7705e/uploads/origins/1ee185cf-dca5-4e67-b4bd-bf143f1b2f3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d3f64855bf4ee5549e7cc1249e5f78e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8bc7705e/uploads/origins/1ee185cf-dca5-4e67-b4bd-bf143f1b2f3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d3f64855bf4ee5549e7cc1249e5f78e, https://si.imgix.net/8bc7705e/uploads/origins/1ee185cf-dca5-4e67-b4bd-bf143f1b2f3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22764e46c07cc4e1fb02af743a952e7e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8bc7705e/uploads/origins/1ee185cf-dca5-4e67-b4bd-bf143f1b2f3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c14e08435681eebd2def495d598becae 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls":